                "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
            },
            "widgets_values": [
                "Two **File: Add** nodes give Wan 3.0 the product as `reference_image_urls` and the voice as `reference_audio_urls`. Both inputs take a list, and the node sends a list even for one file. Wan then shows a host who holds the product and says the line.\n\nKIE has no cancel. If you cancel the run, ComfyUI stops waiting, but KIE still makes the video and bills it. Collect it with **video-03-recover-a-video**."
            ],
            "title": "Note"
        },
